        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Rectangular fragment. Roller print in shades of yellow-brown, pink and black on natural cotton. Repeat shows two couples playing tennis and a girl on a hammock playing with a dog. Interspaces filled with sprays of roses, petunias and other flowers. Faded and worn; a number of breaks. Selvedge present at right only."@en ;
